# Response headers for Cloudflare Pages (dist/public/_headers).
#
# Cloudflare derives a static asset's Content-Type from its file extension, and
# `.apk` is not a known extension, so this rule pins the Android package type
# explicitly. `functions/downloads/[file].ts` sets it on the response as well,
# which is the guaranteed path — see CLOUDFLARE.md before removing either one.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

# Vite emits content-hashed asset filenames, so they can be cached forever.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/downloads/*
  Content-Type: application/vnd.android.package-archive
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
